# =========================================================
# 12_Figure7_Bassez_contextualization.R
#
# PURPOSE
# -------
# Visual and provenance refinement of the audited Figure 7
# generated in 63C_5.
#
# IMPORTANT
# ---------
# NO substantive biological analysis is recomputed here.
#
# This script:
#   1. Reads the exact panel tables generated by 63C_5.
#   2. Uses official 56F_C clone-level FDR values in Panel A.
#   3. Cleans phenotype-state labels for publication.
#   4. Neutralizes the Panel B title so it does not imply
#      a significant E-vs-NE difference.
#   5. Improves Panel C visual hierarchy without removing
#      uncertainty.
#   6. Improves Panel D readability while retaining all
#      audited routes and full, unclipped Delta RF240 range.
#   7. Generates the polished Figure 7 candidate in
#      PDF, PNG and TIFF.
#
# SCIENTIFIC QUESTION
# -------------------
# Does RF240 remodeling track phenotype-state remodeling
# in persistent clonotypes?
#
# FIGURE STRUCTURE
# ----------------
# A. Clone-level continuous phenotype-shift / Delta RF240
# B. Patient-specific association at primary QC
# C. Patient-level QC robustness
# D. RF240 remodeling across phenotype-state transition routes
#
# PRIMARY QC
# ----------
# 100 cells / 10 persistent clonotypes
#
# COLOR CONVENTION
# ----------------
# NE = #D55E00
# E  = #0072B2
#
# =========================================================


# =========================================================
